+-- points rising from its corners and a bone barrow-king ridge running front
+-- to back between them. The face is a bone death-mask with a dark visor slot.
+-- Grave moss creeps over the brim and down a cheek. From the high camera the
+-- points and the pale ridge read as a crown above the shoulders, not another
+-- cloth hood.
